hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2940","Narrated to us Muhammad bin Al-`Ala bin Kurayb, who said: Narrated to us Shu`ayb (meaning Ibn Ishaq), from Hisham (who is Ibn Urwah), from Umm Az-Zubayr bint `Abdur-Rahman bin Al-Harith bin Hisham, who informed him, from `Aishah bint `Abdur-Rahman, her sister, that `Abbad bin `Abdullah entered upon `Aishah bint `Abdur-Rahman."
